<title>FRANCE: France wants greater EU political coordination.</title>
<headline>France wants greater EU political coordination.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Dominique Strauss-Kahn repeated on Monday France wanted Europe to step up political co-operation to boost growth.</p>
<p>He also reaffirmed France's commitment to launching a single European currency on time in 1999.</p>
<p>He made the comments at a news conference to present the results of an audit of public finances given to the government on Monday.</p>
</text>
